1
00:00:00,028 --> 00:00:04,032
This soldier kept fighting World War 2… for 29 years after it ended!

2
00:00:04,032 --> 00:00:08,811
1944. Lieutenant Onoda is sent to a jungle island. Orders: never surrender.

3
00:00:08,811 --> 00:00:13,089
1945: the war ends. Planes drop leaflets. He's sure they're fake!

4
00:00:13,089 --> 00:00:16,171
Newspapers, letters from home… fake, fake, fake.

5
00:00:16,171 --> 00:00:19,081
He fights on… and his raids kill about 30 villagers.

6
00:00:19,081 --> 00:00:25,083
1974. A backpacker goes looking for Onoda, a panda, and the Abominable Snowman. In that order.

7
00:00:25,083 --> 00:00:28,491
He finds Onoda in 4 days! But Onoda won't quit without orders.

8
00:00:28,491 --> 00:00:31,917
Japan finds his old commander… now a bookseller… and flies him in.

9
00:00:31,917 --> 00:00:36,857
Order given. After 29 years, he surrenders… and his rifle still works!
